window.products.push({"id":267177,"name":"Millvado Stainless Steel Ice Cream and Cookie Scoop | Large Sized, Spring Loaded Lever Design, For Sorbet, Melon, Meatballs, Muffins, and More, 3 Ounc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71isMcXUWuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you are looking for an awesome scoop that actually does what it’s meant to do without quitting halfway through the job, you can stop right here. Because this scooper by Millvado is just what you need. Perfect for cookies, ice cream, melon balls, muffins, potatoes, meatballs, and more, this quality made stainless steel, scoop will deliver delightful results, every time. The spring-loaded lever design releases your ice cream smoothly and easily, and it’s so simple to use, too! Just a slight squeeze and your ball will glide right out! It doesn’t take lots of strength at all, which makes this scoop perfect for those with arthritis or a weak grip. Fun for children, too! And it’s soooo versatile, too. You’ll surprise even yourself with the creative uses you come up with for this handy little gadget! Make it yours today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71isMcXUWuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Millvado","source_asin":"B0C3DKSJF7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-267177","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3DKSJF7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3DKSJF7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":267178,"name":"glitzhome Bar Stool Set of 2 Bar Stools Adjustable Swivel Bar Stools Modern Leather Barstool Chairs with Back Contemporary Dining Padded Chairs with M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":179.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81P+18aR+iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Exquisite Craftsmanship】The bar stool consists of plywood frame(EPA TSCA Certificate), painting metal base in matte brown, shiny black PU leather seat and backrest. Overall dimension: 22.05”L× 21.26”W × 44.5”H, perfect size for you, with a weight capacity of up to 260 lbs. You can lean against the back and kick up your feet on the built-in footrest. 【Charming Design】Feature clean lines, timeless soft and breathable black leatherette backrest and seat with antique finish, padded with high-density, resilient fire-retardant foam(CA TB117-2013 Certificate). Combining stylish, modern design with premium quality, the modern set of bar stools are the perfect companion when you sit beside the kitchen table or home bar and you will be able to enjoy for years to come. A blend of fashion and contemporary design matches with your home decor seamlessly. 【Sturdy & Stable】With a large heavy-duty metal base, sturdy plywood frame and upholstered seat&back, the stool provides stability and durability and designed for long time use. Wide padded seat, ergonomic backrest and built-in footrest provides comfortable and enjoyable sitting experience, relieve the pressure exerted to your lumbar spine. 【Adjustable Height】Height of the seat can be adjusted easily by raising the lever under the seat. You can adjust it to different heights with the smooth metal lifting mechanism. The seat height ranges from counter height to bar height (36”- 44.5”), all assure comfort and let you relax at any time. 【Assembly Required】 Simple assembly required, instructions and accessories are included. The package comes as 2 pieces of bar stools. This set of bar stools is suitable for kitchen, dining room, bar, cafe, office and club. Please refer to the size to make sure it is suitable for your bar.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81P+18aR+iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"glitzhome","source_asin":"B0BBLJZNFR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-267178","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBLJZNFR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBLJZNFR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
