window.products.push({"id":267205,"name":"MyBarnwoodFrames - Set of 3, 5x7\" Picture Frames on Hanging Ribbon, Lightly Distressed Edges, Black (Landscape-Portrait-Landscape)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z5S4-adaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"My Barnwood Frames - Distressed Picture Frames, Set of Three 5x7 Photo Frames on Hanging Ribbon, Lightly Sanded Edges. Includes Glass, Cardboard Backing, and black Hanging Ribbon (pre-assembled) free! Your MyBarnwoodFrames order comes with glass, cardboard backing, and the attached hanging ribbon. The frames hangs 29.5 inches tall, 10.5 inches wide, and .75 inches thick. The ribbon adds roughly 4 inches to the height. Built from USA-made Solid Hardwood. Collage frames are multi-picture frames to showcase multiple pictures or photographs at the same time. You'll never have to straighten your family photo frames again. Your precious photographs will ALWAYS stay put.When you live off the land for generations, nature will always be a part of who you are. So it’s no surprise that this family-owned company has come back to its roots. Our ancestors have made their living as farmers, dairymen, construction laborers, and craftsmen. They've irrigated corn fields, herded cattle, threshed wheat, and bottled fresh fruit. Along the way, they taught their children an appreciation for simplicity and natural beauty, and we hope that appreciation is reflected in the craftsmanship of the rustic decor. Our mission is to connect people to home decor that is beautiful, functional, high-quality, yet simple. We want to help people create attractive rustic spaces where friends and families can connect and enjoy each other's company. Our core beliefs are: Family is WHY Family is WHY Promise Good, Deliver GREAT Promise Good, Deliver GREAT Do more with less Do more with less Continuous Incremental Improvement Continuous Incremental Improvement Optimism -- Apply hope and elbow grease and things will always work out Optimism -- Apply hope and elbow grease and things will always work out Our dream to provide unique and quality products in the home decor marketplace became a reality in 2008 and we've providing customers with great products since. We're excited to welcome you as members of the MyBarnwoodFrames family!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z5S4-adaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"My Barnwood Frames","source_asin":"B072L3LWPK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-267205","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072L3LWPK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072L3LWPK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
