window.products.push({"id":267289,"name":"UINI Fall Tablecloth Autumn Leaves Damask Table Cloth Thanksgiving Tablecloths - 60\"x84\" Machine Washable Jacquard Table Cover for Fall, Harvest & Tha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pkzb8E8iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The fall tablecloths brings you a tablecloth that is perfect for your holiday decor, featured a traditional allover medium format woven damask design with a subtle visual texture. 1.AUTUMN DESIGN This autumn tablecloth has a classic fall leaves pattern and warm harvest color which is full of autumn festive atmosphere, which is the tablecloth best fit for autumn and Thanksgiving Day. 2.PREMIUM FABRIC Our yarn dyed fall table cloth features damask maple leaves pattern and classic strong sewing. As you can see, the texture looks familiar, and they are made with premium polyester, not traditionally damask that is made with silk thread, adding a sense of understated and luxury to your dining. 3.VARIETY OF SCENARIOS This autumn leaf Thanksgiving damask weave fabric tablecloth was designed to be a favorite for your busy home or restaurant. Suitable for your dining-room table, kitchen table, cafes, fall, autumn, thanksgiving and Christmas dining, entertaining, parties, weddings and celebrations. Washing Instructions: 1.Machine washable, hanging to dry. Do not bleach. 2.For the color vivid, please wash it in cold water. Specifications: Pattern: Autumn Maple Leaves Material: Polyester, and it is more durable than cotton Size: 52x52inch/132x132cm, 60x84inch/153x213cm, 60x120inch/153x306cm and 18\"x18\" Napkins Set of 4 Suitable for: Square Table/ Rectangle Table Package Includes: 1 x Fall Tablecloth Warm Tips: 1.Table cloths size ≠ Table size, the size of the table cover is usually larger than the size of your table, please kindly refer to the size guide before purchasing.  2.Please allow 1 - 2cm (0.4\" - 0.8\") deviations due to manual measurement; 3.Please understand the tiny color vary from the product due to different light and screen display.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pkzb8E8iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UINI","source_asin":"B0BVRCVRNF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-267289","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVRCVRNF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVRCVRNF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
