window.products.push({"id":267393,"name":"BALDR FM/AM LED Radio Clock Dual Alarm, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lF5MKHnZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"BALDR Alarm Clock Radio AM/FM Radio, Dual Alarms, USB Port Charging, Digital LED Display with Dimmer, Snooze, Programmable Sleep Timer - Black Decent Alarm Clock with Large, Clear Orange LED Display Clearly view the time on the large and clear LED screen with nice orange illuminated jumbo digits . No squinting to read the time, even without your glass .Decent look, clean, simple, aesthetically pleasing design. Not too big, not too small, easily fits into any decor to bedroom, office, and travel needs. Adjustable Brightness Control With the \"Snooze/Dimmer\" button , you are able to adjust the brightness to high or low for comfort view, or turn the brightness completely off for night sleep. There are 4 brightness levels: 100%, 50%, 20% and off. Wake up to AM/FM Radios Single on/off radio button, tuning in your pre-set favorite channels with volume adjustment. Built in high quality speaker, the sound is loud and clear. Each morning wake up to either favorite music or the regular tone. Programmable Sleep Timer Fall asleep to the radio using the programmable count down sleep timer. 15-120 minutes optional. Gradual Alarm with Adjustable Volume The gradual wake alarm feature starts with a subtle, low volume and then gradually increases to a reasonably high level in order to gently wake you up from sleep. Alarms sound can be adjusted to your desired level whatever select wake up to buzzer or radio. Two Alarms & Snooze Button Separate alarms can be used for different people, different schedule, or different days of the week. Snooze function will let you catch an extra shuteye. 5 minutes interval to mute the sound for every click button , which can be repeated to one hour until turned off . USB Charging Port It is designed for other smart device like cellphone, tablet etc. charging on the same bedside table. Handy and convenient and uses only one power outlet. Build-in Battery BackupA backup battery keeps the clock working during a power outage .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lF5MKHnZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BALDR","source_asin":"B0753GN25N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-267393","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0753GN25N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0753GN25N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
