window.products.push({"id":267486,"name":"Caron & Doucet - Cutting Board & Butcher Block Conditioning Oil & Wood Finishing Wax Bundle | 100% Plant-Based & Vegan, Best for Wood & Bamboo Conditi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815A2li4cHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% COCONUT BASED CUTTING BOARD & BUTCHER BLOCK OIL | Don’t fall for the competitor’s concoctions! Unlike other plant-based butcher block and cutting board oils on the market, our formula base is 100% coconut derived (most of the cheaper “coconut” plant-based products contain palm, soy or even mineral oil). Our cutting board oil is made in Canada with a refined coconut oil that doesn't go rancid or sticky. It is also an ingredient used in specialty food production making it food contact safe. HYDRATES & CONDITIONS | Designed to penetrate deep into the fibers of the wood to hydrate & conditions. Prolongs the life of wood & bamboo kitchenware by preventing cracking due to water damage or over drying. WILL NOT GO RANCID | Unlike common kitchen oils like flax, canola, olive & linseed, our products are made through a solventless refinement process which removes the long chain fatty acids, resulting in a product that will not go rancid or smell bad. VEGAN CUTTING BOARD AND BUTCHER BLOCK WAX | Makes cleaning easier by creating a protective layer to help repel liquids and lock in the cutting board oil. Made with a rice bran and coconut oil base with a proprietary blend of light essential oils that help to naturally eliminate odors (while not transferring onto food). Prevents food from drying and getting stuck on the wood & makes washing and cleaning easier. TRUSTED CARON FAMILY GUARANTEE | Our family has been formulating and manufacturing 100% natural products in Canada since 1999. Our company is family owned and operated with a top priority being the satisfaction of our customers. I am confident that you & your family will enjoy the products just as much as we do. If for any reason you are not 100% completely satisfied, we’ll refund your money! - Stephen Caron, President","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815A2li4cHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CARON & DOUCET","source_asin":"B074Q28NN4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-267486","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074Q28NN4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074Q28NN4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
