window.products.push({"id":267603,"name":"Silicone Stretch Lids,12 Pack Reusable Durable and Expandable Lids, Silicone Covers for Fresh Food & Leftovers - Keep Food Fresh, Stretch for Containe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71I2qXwYDrL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"【Safe & Enveironmental Silicone Lids】Made by 100% Food grade silicone environmental protection material. BPA free . Resistant to high and low temperature from -40 to 240 ° C, making them useful in refrigerators, microwaves, electric ovens and dishwashers. 【Reusable Silicone Lids】Made of high quality silicone, tight and seal, flexible, durable for reusable. It can be used multiple times, helping you save money and say goodbye to traditional plastic wrap and zip storage bags. 【6 Different Sizes,Total 12pcs】Silicone stretch lids comes in 6pcs round lids and 6pcs retangle lids allowing you to fit almost all of your dishes, bowls, cans, jars and containers that can be covered! Ideal for storing leftovers, gruels, stacked bowls, uncooked drinks, leftover fruits and vegetables. 【Super Practical & Easy to Handle】StillCool silicone stretch lids fit directly over bowls, jar lids, and hot food items themselves, helping you avoid a container transfer. Please NOTE: Due to the material nature of the silicone, to avoid slipping, make sure that your hands and the outer edge of the bowl and the silicone covers are perfectly dry (NO oil and water) during operation. It is not suitable for sharp objects. 【Tearproof & Leakproof】Extra thick silicone lids provide better elasticity that forms an airtight sealed space for the container, preventing food from accidental spills or leaks. Even with a hundred times of stretching over different types of containers, these stretch lids will neither lose its strength or shape, nor tear, crack or warp like regular plastic lids. If you find your silicone lids no longer work out like it did before, please contact us for help anytime.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71I2qXwYDrL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Swonuk","source_asin":"B08395B3B6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-267603","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08395B3B6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08395B3B6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":267604,"name":"Ice Cube Tray With Lid and Bin, Ice Trays for Freezer,Ice tray with storage bin,Press type ice cube maker Easy Release, (2*24 Ice Trays,1Storage Conta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lrQ-T77fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧊【Easy to release】This ice cube tray with lid is easier to release ice cubes than other ice cube trays, After taking the ice cube tray out of the refrigerator, put the Ice Trays for Freezer upside down into the ice storage bin, cover it The lid is squeezed down and the ice cubes are released instantly, no need to tap or turn the ice cube tray, and the ice cubes won't fall all over the place and stain the table and hand，Removing ice cubes from ice cube trays is no longer a daunting task. 🧊【Approved Materials】Our ice cube tray with bin are all made of high quality food grade materials, odor free and more durable. 🧊【Right Size】Space-saving master. This perfect ice cube trays with lids for freezer measures 11.2(L) x 5.12(W) x 3.74(H) inches, set includes: 2 ice cube trays, 1 lid, 1 storage bin, 1 Ice shovel. Great for RV refrigerators and home refrigerators. The ice cube storage bin can hold two ice cube tray for daily ice cube needs。 🧊【Perfect Small Ice Cubes】: This ice trays for freezer with bin can make 48 ice cubes at a time, so you can enjoy iced coffee or cocktails anytime. Great for RVs, family use and parties. Our ice cube tray with bin can also be used to make miniature desserts such as jellies, chocolate, baby food, frozen yogurt, and are the right size for chewing ice cubes. 🧊【Easy to use and clean】Our ice cube trays for freezer is easy to use, just fill the ice cube trays with lids with water, freeze for 4-5 hours, you can get 48 ice cubes, double-layer design large capacity storage ice cubes, making Ice and ice storage can be done at the same time. The ice trays for freezer is designed with rounded corners for easy cleaning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lrQ-T77fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bretewi","source_asin":"B09WMQG6HF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-267604","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WMQG6HF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WMQG6HF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
