window.products.push({"id":267636,"name":"Aeergured 2 Pack Portable Handheld Fan, 10-24 Hours Folding Desk Fans, Personal Fan Rechargeable Small Fan, Battery Operated Mini Pocket Fan Power Ban","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qx7A+aozL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄【High-Performance Battery】The battery fan operated by 2000mAh premium Rechargeable battery with high-performance and efficiency.Offers you continuous working time with 10-24 hours depending on different wind speed. The maximum rotating speed of the pocket fan is 4000 rpm which is enough for personal use to keep you cool. Perfect partner in hot summer when shopping, travelling, camping, etc. ❄【Foldable Portable Fan】This mini fan has a foldable design that hides the fan blades and is compact and easy to slide into pockets and purses for easy carrying and storage. When the cover is flipped out and the fan is adjusted to 180°, you get a portable handheld fan. And when folded to 270°, it can become a powerful desk fan that could sit on a table. ❄【Fast Charge & Power Bank Function】You can use a wall charger, laptop, power bank to charge this battery operated fan, which only needs about 3 hours to get fully charged. Besides, output port makes the mini hand fan to be a power bank in an emergency, supplying power for mobile phone, MP3, etc. ❄【Portable Size】This cute fan is only 3.6*3.7*11cm/1.4* 1.5* 4.5in, 4.6oz, you can easily put it in your pocket or bag. Our portable mini fan have 2 adjustable speeds which can be switched easily by pressing the button. At the same time, with no frame design, it makes noise low to 50db that causes no bother during work. ❆【Safety Handheld Fan】Made in special soft material, the fan blades are very safe. If you accidentally touch the rotating blades, the fan will automatically stop and keep you safe. Featuring with adorable look, this mini fan can also be a great gift choice for your family and friends. Cute, tiny, and useful gadgets for most people in summer. Packing List: Pink Handheld fan x 1, White Handhel fan x 1, Charging cable x 2, User manual x 2.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qx7A+aozL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aeergured","source_asin":"B0C491MYQ3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-267636","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C491MYQ3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C491MYQ3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
