window.products.push({"id":267754,"name":"ALDKitchen Deep Fryer | Stainless Steel | 1 & 2 Baskets (2-basket)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":169.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dxLKGKg4L._AC_SL1316_.jpg","description":"✪ COMMERCIAL USE: This electric 2-basket deep fryer with a 12 L capacity is suitable for French fries, chicken wings, onion rings, and other snacks that need to be fried. The power consumption is 3.5kW. The heat level is adjusted with knobs on the front panel, and the temperature range is 60-200 °C. The machine is perfect for fast-food restaurants, bars, street food points, and other food&beverage businesses. ✪ OVERHEAT PROTECTION: The fryer is equipped with a reset protecting button to prevent too high temperatures. When the machine gets too hot, it might stop working to ensure safe usage. Firstly, to reset, turn the temperature knobs to the \"0\" position and unplug the fryer. Let the machine cool down, and then push the reset button. If overheating caused the problem, then your deep fryer should start working again ✪ STAINLESS STEEL: This kitchen appliance is made of 201 stainless steel, known for its strength and durability. Stainless steel is commonly used for professional kitchen equipment production because of its corrosion resistance and the ability to withstand high temperatures. It is hard to break or deform. Stainless steel equipment is easy to clean, and it looks good even after years of extensive usage. ✪ CONVENIENT USAGE: This deep fryer is manually controlled - plug it in and adjust the heat level with the temperature knobs. You can easily lift the stainless steel baskets with plastic handles that can be dismantled. The tanks can be taken apart for cleaning with hands or in a dishwasher. The machine comes with lids that protect the kitchen from oil splashes. Non-slip tiny feet secure the fryer on the tabletop. ✪ 100% GUARANTEED QUALITY: Great customer support with a flexible return policy and a money-back guarantee. Your satisfaction is our main priority, that is why we are constantly improving our service and value any feedback. We are always available for any questions and concerns you might have. We provide warranty and after-sale service support to make sure you are fully satisfied with your experience and our product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dxLKGKg4L._AC_SL1316_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALDKitchen","source_asin":"B0B864FCN5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-267754","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B864FCN5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B864FCN5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
