window.products.push({"id":267766,"name":"Rerii Cube Storage, Organizer Shelves, Bedroom Closet Storage, Standing Shelving Units for Living Room, Study Room, Office","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NLGzFENlL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Cube storage organizer with 4 tiers 12 cubes storage shelf, each tier with 3 storage cubes, each cube with 4 supporting iron pipes and a fabric. It makes this cube storage have better load bearing capacity. The size of the cubes fit most of daily necessaries, such as the bedroom storage, clothes organizer, books, dolls, shoes, toy, ball, shoe boxes and more. You can put this storage cubes at the anywhere you like, study room, living room, office and more. Cube storage organizer instructions, please be patient when you install the cube storage clothes organizer for closet. Because it is a DIY product. You need to install it before you can use it for your stuffs. There are 92 iron pipes, 20 plastic connectors and 31 fabric. There is installation guide inner the package. Please read carefully and install it according to the manual. And you can check the product detail page. There is a video. You can learn to install from the video too. Cube Storage installation suggestion, please use the enclosed wood hammer to help your installation of organizers and storage. During the installation, please make sure all the parts are connected tightly. So that when finishes installation, it will be very sturdy. If the cube storage is not connected tightly, do please use the hammer to erect the parts and push them to make them tightly. We suggest you wear gloves when you install this cube storage. Cube Storage organizer instructions for use, please put the heaviest stuffs at the bottom cubes. And the light stuffs at the top cubes. It will let the storage shelf sturdier and stronger. For example, you put your books at the bottom cubes and put your clothes at the top cubes. DON'T suggest setting super heavy things on this storage shelf, such as the dumbbell. Light to medium weight items held is the most suitable. Cube Storage range of use - Nice for children's books and some toys. As a wardrobe or shoes rack for folded clothes and shoes storage, also perfect for organizing some snacks and foods in a pantry. The storage closet organizer is perfect for space-saving with an attractive look, it helps transform your boring room into a modern marvel. With this 5-tier storage shelf, you once mess apartment will become more organized and no more search all around for the items you want","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NLGzFENlL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rerii","source_asin":"B087CNLHWV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-267766","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087CNLHWV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087CNLHWV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
