window.products.push({"id":267773,"name":"HLC.ME Jefferson Faux Silk Semi Sheer Light Filtering Microfiber Lined Grommet Lightweight Window Curtains Drapery for Bedroom, Dining Room & Living R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kMKoC0cQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UNLIKE CHEAP STANDARD SHEER VOILE CURTAINS, THESE MAINTAIN A SUBSTANTIAL AMOUNT OF PRIVACY: These faux silk curtains allows you to enjoy some natural sunlight nature brings in through your living room or master bedroom while comfortably maintaining the privacy of your home so no one peeks in. DOUBLE LAYER - FAUX SILK and MICROFIBER LINING: The added extra layer of microfiber lining provides additional privacy from peeking pedestrians. Plus, an added bonus, these double layer curtains will drape beautifully to the floor without leaving the side hems curled up when hung on your windows. UNLIKE NARROW CHEAP CURTAINS - THESE ARE PERFECT FIT WIDE CURTAINS - Do you not hate it when your curtains does not fully cover your windows? These curtains are not narrow, like others, measuring 37 inches. These curtains measure 54 inch to cover up a standard single window. WRINKLE FREE & EASY CARE: Your curtains are easy to iron and steam out of the package. Creases will fall right off and ready to be hung. For best drapery look, it is suggested to machine wash your pair of panels. EXPERT CRAFTSMANSHIP - 100% MONEY BACK GURANTEED: If you are not happy with your curtains, please contact us and we will rectify the situation within 24 hours to ensure you are satisfied with our window curtains. Package contains two (2) faux linen semi sheer window curtains.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kMKoC0cQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HLC.ME","source_asin":"B08F78TSW5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-267773","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F78TSW5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F78TSW5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
